# cmd.exe misreads labels in a .cmd saved with LF line endings. Measured 2026-10-04 on
# Windows 11: run-server.cmd from the codeload tarball printed "no encuentra la etiqueta
# por lotes especificada: loop" and its restart loop died on the first restart. This
# forces CRLF in every checkout AND in `git archive`, which is what codeload serves --
# core.autocrlf never reaches the tarball, so it cannot be the fix.
*.cmd text eol=crlf
